            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/full+subcategory"} full subcategory
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
            on finite sets.
          %p
            (For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive
            purposes, take the strictest sense of ‘finite’.)
          %p
            It is easy (and thus common) to make
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
